# profile: chat   -- the class Zulip. OFF by default: chat is not reachable
# from the student network during a session. Turn on with
# `cs326 profile enable chat`, off again with `cs326 profile disable chat`.
#
# Three hosts, not one: the realm serves the app shell, static.zulipchat.com
# serves its JS/CSS (nothing renders without it), and gravatar serves the
# message avatars.
#
# Named exactly rather than allowing the zulipchat.com parent, which would
# admit every other organisation's Zulip too.
usfca-cs326-f26.zulipchat.com
static.zulipchat.com
secure.gravatar.com

# If image/file attachments fail in class, Zulip Cloud redirects
# /user_uploads/ to a presigned S3 URL on its own bucket host. Find the exact
# name with `cs326 debug on` and `cs326 log` while reproducing, then
# `cs326 allow add <that-host> chat`. Do NOT allow s3.amazonaws.com broadly --
# that is every bucket on AWS.
